                                                "sense_id": "4a8a977e-a13c-30b0-9ea6-2cc4cfcb1099",
                                                "text": "And the rubbers you hide / In your top left pocket"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afec4792-923c-4709-9132-75f2bf71ebf7",
                                                "sense_id": "4a8a977e-a13c-30b0-9ea6-2cc4cfcb1099",
                                                "text": "Don't have sex, because you will get pregnant and die! Don't have sex in the missionary position, don't have sex standing up, just don't do it, OK, promise? OK, now everybody take some rubbers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00f3adfb-beb8-463e-bfb7-4c3782656bcb",
                                                "sense_id": "4a8a977e-a13c-30b0-9ea6-2cc4cfcb1099",
                                                "text": "My daddy said \"Treat young girls like your mother\" / My momma said \"Trust no hoe, use a rubber\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "982dd2b6-c707-3811-ab85-65cc31dee6f5",
                                        "entry_id": "bee1068d-1dee-3df4-96e9-a1e925c69f69",
